    "title": "Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce Living 'Pretty Woman' Movie In Reverse, Jokes Brother Jason of Hollywood Remake - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Kansas City Chiefs tight end Travis Kelce and his brother Jason have seen their New Heights podcast skyrocket in popularity over the past year or so. With the brothers doing great in the podcast space, a couple of weeks ago, the thought of reviewing the movie Pretty Woman came up, and nothing really came of it...until now. On the latest episode of the New Heights podcast, Travis and Jason were talking about the movie, when Travis stated that a \"Pretty Man\" movie has to come out. \"I think we need to make Pretty Man,\" Travis said . \"We need to have a CEO billionaire woman be so high-class that she doesn't know where she's going, she doesn't know how to drive a car.\" That sounds like a good movie idea from the future Hall of Famer, but as Travis was finishing up his thought, Jason gave his thoughts and stated something rather funny. \"Travis, you're living Pretty Man right now,\" Jason said. The pair then burst into laughter, with Jason seemingly taking a light-hearted shot at Travis and Taylor Swift's relationship with Travis being the \"Pretty Man\" in that dynamic. As the Chiefs have begun their training camp, we imagine that Travis and his new nickname of \"Pretty Man\" will certainly get mentioned around the locker room as the tight end seems to fit the bill to a tee. Of course, we don't know if a movie like that would ever get made, but if it does, we could think of worse people to headline it than Travis. Related: Chiefs Excited For Return Of Speedy Receiver Duo Related: What Is Chiefs' 'Worst-Case Scenario' In 2025?",
